  "citation": "Jones M H; Curtis P S (1999): A Database of Herbaceous Vegetation Responses to Elevated Atmospheric CO2 (NDP-073). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center, Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/VRC.NDP073",
